Build passes. The fix uses the official Next.js pattern:

```typescript
export async function register() {
  if (process.env.NEXT_RUNTIME === "nodejs") {
    await import("./src/utils/orpc.server");
  }
}
```

The `register` function is called in **all runtimes** (both nodejs and edge). The `orpc.server` module uses Node.js `crypto` via the database/auth packages, so it must only be imported when `NEXT_RUNTIME === "nodejs"`.

**Source**: [Next.js Instrumentation Docs](https://nextjs.org/docs/app/building-your-application/optimizing/instrumentation#importing-runtime-specific-code)

